PHASE 2 — Task Runner (headless AgentRunner / TaskExecutor port)          [DONE]
================================================================================

  Goal: execute AgenticTask objects inside the server with no Flutter/UI
        dependencies.  Mirror lib/services/task_runner_service.dart logic
        but use server-side services only.

  [DONE] server/lib/runner/server_task_runner.dart
        - runTask(AgenticTask task) → TaskRunResult
        - Progress via structured log lines (ServerLogger), NOT ChangeNotifier
        - Abort support: CancellationToken pattern (Completer<void> cancelToken)
        - On finish: update task row (last_run, next_run, status) via
          ServerDuckDbService
        - Write output text to $TEALKIT_DATA_DIR/output/<task_id>/<timestamp>.txt
          (mirrors TaskOutputFileService)

  [DONE] server/lib/runner/server_llm_runner.dart
        - Wrap LangChain chain construction; support all providers defined in
          ServerLlmSettingsService (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, Azure)
        - Use secondary provider fallback (provider2/model2) on 429/503
        - Fixed: HumanChatMessage content wrapped with ChatMessageContent.text()
        - Fixed: response.usage?.inputTokens / outputTokens null-safe access
        - Fixed: removed unsupported httpClient param from ChatOpenAI
        - dart analyze → 0 issues

  [DONE] server/lib/runner/server_tool_registry.dart
        - Register MCP tools available on server (internal_mcp_configs +
          github_mcp_servers from DB)
        - Spawn/manage child processes for MCP stdio servers
        - HTTP/SSE client for remote MCP servers
        - Fixed: McpToolConfig.url → serverUrl, id → serverUrl key, name null-safe

  [DONE] server/lib/runner/server_mcp_client.dart
        - Port of lib/services/mcp_client.dart without dart:ui
        - JSON-RPC over stdio or HTTP/SSE

  NOTE: Do NOT import anything from lib/ (main app).  All types must be
        re-implemented or copied into server/lib/.
        dart analyze → 0 issues (verified 2026-04-09)

