================================================================================
NOTES / KNOWN CONSTRAINTS
================================================================================

  * dart_duckdb ResultSet: always call .fetchAll() before iterating.
    Do NOT use .map() / .isEmpty / .first directly on ResultSet.

  * No flutter/foundation.dart in server/ package — use dart:core only.
    ChangeNotifier → plain callbacks or StreamControllers.

  * MCP child processes: use dart:io Process.start() with stdio pipes.
    On Linux/Docker, PATH must include npx / python3 / uvx as needed.

  * LangChain: langchain_community is NOT in pubspec yet. Add if needed
    for document loaders / web search tools.

  * AES key bootstrap: if $dataDir/master.key is missing on first run,
    ServerCredentialCipher generates and saves it automatically.

  * All phases assume Linux/Docker as target runtime.
    Windows paths / PowerShell are irrelevant for server/ package.
